This msg is directed at those of you who are trying to bring
up NetHack on the Mac.

The Mac port was written, as you know, by Johnny Lee, who worked
on it without the development team's help (since none of us knows
anything about the Mac).  The port, once received, was hand-patched
into the code by us and in that process we probably made some errors.

Johnny did a wonderful job (which we might have botched a bit), but
no one, by himself, can hope to get all the kinks out when dealing
with such a complex job.  Your help in debugging and enhancing the Mac
port will be much appreciated.  Please let us know of any change you
had to make in order to make the port work properly.  Thank you.

For the development team,

-Izchak


